          "identifier": "NTS-107",
          "number": 107,
          "title": "Decision: shared links never expire",
          "description": "People paste links into long-lived documents, and a link that silently dies is worse than one that stays open. Decision: shared links never expire. They stay valid until the note is deleted.",
